tests/fixtures/public_api_listing/glob/facade/src/lib.rs 2024  rustdoc JSON fixture crate for the public API listing tests; each fixture is a standalone workspace so Cargo can generate its own docs
tests/fixtures/public_api_listing/missing/core/src/lib.rs 2024  rustdoc JSON fixture crate for the public API listing tests; each fixture is a standalone workspace so Cargo can generate its own docs
tests/fixtures/public_api_listing/missing/facade/src/lib.rs 2024  rustdoc JSON fixture crate for the public API listing tests; each fixture is a standalone workspace so Cargo can generate its own docs
